Sval: the distribution add-ons scan logs at debug

`installDistributionAddons` runs whenever the application changes, which is
every update, and logged each folder it looks in as a warning. Looking in
a folder that holds nothing is the ordinary case. The scan's own findings,
a file that is not an XPI and an add-on that fails to install, still warn.

